  | ITjavascriptcallconv
  | ITmdo (Maybe FastString)
  | ITfamily
  | ITrole
  | ITgroup
  | ITby
  | ITusing
  | ITpattern
  | ITstatic
  | ITstock
  | ITanyclass
  | ITvia

